  "note": "The built core combines this repository's MIT integration with Geartowns and the libraries it carries, and is distributed under the GPL-3.0-or-later. The source of each part is linked below by exact commit. No firmware is in the package: the FM Towns ROMs are the user's.",
  "components": [
